Subject: Freedom of Information Request -- Contract RB-PROC-2024-Q3-117 vote minutes

To the Records Officer,

I am writing under the Freedom of Information Act to request copies of
all evaluation committee vote minutes relating to the procurement procedure
published as reference RB-PROC-2024-Q3-117 (Flood-Barrier Reinforcement Works — Phase 3), closed
2024-09-03.

In particular, I request:
(a) The names of all committee members present at each vote;
(b) Any conflict-of-interest declarations received or recorded;
(c) The final award vote record, including any abstentions.

Yours sincerely,
Marcus Delacroix
Riverwatch News

